            <div xml:id="m-5ae7e756-d410-47a9-85f3-cb0d1face5ba">
              <lg xml:id="m-99be0faf-0311-4563-9eea-ad1be755645c">
                <l xml:id="m-472018df-89d6-40e3-a2eb-5901ac324d0c" facs="#m-c125a4bb-f935-4183-bc03-520272170837" label="ambiguous">ces</l><l xml:id="m-8e85c657-ad84-46a4-ae9e-e80937fe2238" facs="#m-338e6532-1eb4-4065-89b0-f077289bf6fa" label="ambiguous">Maundy Thursday</l><l xml:id="m-c766c018-fda5-4e66-9a0e-1e2053f51fc3" facs="#m-4a2a95b1-32f0-4ad1-b64d-f48bdcb9d864" label="lyrics-like">per nos, et mi-se-re-á-tur nóstri. Nos au¬</l><l xml:id="m-e37a880e-ad69-4547-b53a-4a31833a3113" facs="#m-1f99b7cd-94b5-40a7-a11c-04b1a9f7835f" label="ambiguous">tem.</l><l xml:id="m-7e1214d7-1382-4fa2-9faa-49aac421d69a" facs="#m-93ba972b-ee98-4f48-889f-a67ea4e2a21b" label="ambiguous">VERSES AD LIBITUM</l><l xml:id="m-035fed02-26d6-40de-a905-9fe482b4a7d0" facs="#m-9a658591-52be-4df3-98d6-d9660f4a92ab" label="lyrics-like">in ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-5d121aa3-d2a9-4696-914b-cf1be536e2ec" facs="#m-4f0968a3-2125-4c30-9882-4faa3cbe4d75" label="lyrics-like">2. Ut cognoscámus in térra ví-am tú-am:</l><l xml:id="m-085fd746-13e5-41e2-af0a-7042f2d2fa9a" facs="#m-b9441580-07a5-4bbf-b75b-0bbcd2d78047" label="lyrics-like">géntibus sa-lu-tá-re tú-um. Nos au¬ tem.</l><l xml:id="m-2ce9cbe4-a345-41b5-a93e-a91cbe8628c8" facs="#m-b3355582-85c0-4d0a-aae8-dcc8092c98f2" label="lyrics-like">3. Confi-te-ántur tí-bi pó-pu-li, Dé-us: * confi-te-ántur</l><l xml:id="m-89a6d365-22fd-4e19-9a55-3b3f2c1ef5f9" facs="#m-7a9a4e99-9cdc-4f2e-a4ab-f7291b4a5755" label="lyrics-like">tsbi pópu-li ómnes. Nos au- tem. Kyrie IV or IX.</l><l xml:id="m-a2194ce4-5147-42f7-af77-35e73a8fef0d" facs="#m-eb69e218-9613-4d33-89ca-5819ac843a63" label="text-like">6. When the celebrant has reached the altar with the ministers lor serversl,</l><l xml:id="m-76bc7c43-f72f-4fcc-b2ab-905397a56f08" facs="#m-8e37d9b3-9436-4518-a01f-4270827d41b0" label="text-like">he recites the introductory pravers with the Confiteor, goes up the steps and</l><l xml:id="m-bd2096e1-dfa4-4e32-a23e-0ab2f322b992" facs="#m-92d1b784-ca27-44eb-ab22-13353f864140" label="text-like">hisses the altar in the middle; he censes it in the usual way even at a simple</l><l xml:id="m-13138eaf-0f71-4cb0-b95a-50cb216b39ad" facs="#m-5c128e78-25d2-4af6-b1b5-3a32f261b92a" label="text-like">"ung Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-87194990-26ec-4238-b3cc-175b8c4b2f52" facs="#m-040d6fc6-b2be-4014-b49f-7583e41fa56b" label="lyrics-like">7. After censing the altar the celebrant reads the Introit and Kyrie, eléison</l><l xml:id="m-eec8ce42-28cb-49be-b7de-9294df34f53c" facs="#m-2f4f4b23-9270-4d80-b0d2-66db4a20fd3f" label="lyrics-like">and intones the Glória in excélsis. The bells are rung and the organ is plaved,</l><l xml:id="m-61386329-3fb4-4a35-83b6-c436c267fea7" facs="#m-e5a8badc-a095-42bd-9d21-e39f34fb0233" label="lyrics-like">but from nou onwards they are silent until the Glória in excélsis of the Mass</l><l xml:id="m-4153f83c-5e70-4245-8e5b-d1cbb5fce4c9" facs="#m-ccf0b2c6-45f6-4789-82c5-0e6af77d7c2e" label="text-like">of the Easter Vigil.</l><l xml:id="m-d0ec4d91-6e1b-40ad-8c3e-aeb579f46a40" facs="#m-b3dd9252-8bc9-4655-9051-6e17ada232de" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-efae0c25-eae6-4182-b18f-5ba33cf42f29" facs="#m-207f9017-8b4e-40ec-a4e5-6e5d90e9a02d" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-68b516c3-2654-4c1f-9eae-af011b33c3fd" facs="#m-4da59384-f228-4e59-9ac6-48047ed59f4c" label="lyrics-like">ster, divérsa utrisque intulit sti¬</l><l xml:id="m-83ffff5b-7a45-425c-977b-4533beda923c" facs="#m-9077a7aa-a47b-4c7c-a443-4920b61138cf" label="lyrics-like">Eus, a quo et Judas reátus</l><l xml:id="m-fc1e6128-ad9e-4559-b60c-2d7d38ca1dca" facs="#m-72b71cb0-39de-4dae-acf3-5436039021ff" label="lyrics-like">O sui pœnam, et confessiónis</l><l xml:id="m-005cd3c1-aad4-46a4-a841-61762aab4751" facs="#m-8ac81b33-e096-4a47-a07a-b61476b3dd13" label="lyrics-like">péndia meritórum; “ita nobis,</l><l xml:id="m-13fcf61e-a902-402d-8f9b-6e3b6b245a50" facs="#m-1fe2cf2e-1ee1-45bb-a11f-510e6db168b2" label="lyrics-like">abláto vetustátis erróre, resur¬</l><l xml:id="m-efba6e05-0267-4425-b5b9-bdedcb350ab0" facs="#m-7531bbae-e272-488b-8776-68d7ae58f76c" label="lyrics-like">suae latro praémium sumpsit,</l><l xml:id="m-ffa97464-75db-4c27-8148-369d97b3bc06" facs="#m-00786849-085c-4deb-9a08-86d3b70b41bf" label="lyrics-like">concéde nobis tuae propitiatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-f6c56c0b-02ca-4c66-bad1-3d55603b955c" facs="#m-bcb17fd4-ab9b-4b4a-92cb-11a0acf210c2" label="lyrics-like">rectiónis suae grátiam largiátur:</l><l xml:id="m-c7cec500-0bd4-4397-a8fc-2a7cb937ce2f" facs="#m-429482f7-5a22-4713-951f-23755cbbc00d" label="lyrics-like">efféctum: t ut, sicut in passióne</l><l xml:id="m-9a2e3e3b-98db-465c-a1e5-da78dc4ad8b4" facs="#m-48f8dad9-3284-4a02-9976-c12d6f343af0" label="ambiguous">Qui tecum vivit et regnat in</l><l xml:id="m-c450a1c0-56c6-4a21-a8fd-d44871ecbf6e" facs="#m-d5b631b5-c0a3-4d68-af58-6d847d3b1512" label="lyrics-like">sua Jesus Christus, Dóminus no¬ unitáte...</l><l xml:id="m-8e7900e7-92c9-4cec-bc4e-976cc22c2c90" facs="#m-6d9c91a6-8ec2-4e33-a656-8486d2ffe401" label="text-like">This Collect only is said.</l><l xml:id="m-d6ee07c9-918e-4998-969d-4ab481e7c5e4" facs="#m-21b3e339-de6b-427d-9ad3-ee571d63f79f" label="text-like">IIf Mass is sung, in the simple rite a reader, wearing a surplice, may read</l><l xml:id="m-1e68774f-ec5d-40fc-b386-c39096f0ccb4" facs="#m-972c7160-021d-4c2a-887f-2dea0dad70f4" label="text-like">or sins the Epistle; uhile the celebrant stands at the altar and listens.]</l><l xml:id="m-d34ea4b6-c18c-4969-9ced-150cec04d424" facs="#m-be522423-8fe5-4d1f-aa35-827442140de7" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 1Cor, 11, 20-32</l><l xml:id="m-3f133ad2-aab2-4022-9b50-1c3db2304025" facs="#m-9458ee06-bb1e-4aa3-84f8-ce9c7742de82" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Conveniéntibus vobis quisque enim suam cenam prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-51272cbd-cfc2-4251-a816-be3d268f2370" facs="#m-bedf31ff-625f-4d7f-a74d-f700131b9a3b" label="ambiguous">in unum, jam non est domi¬</l><l xml:id="m-85c5022e-cc78-4cca-b671-ff25bbaf2bb9" facs="#m-2341191a-f415-4fd7-9a94-a52e87e80efd" label="lyrics-like">súmit ad manducándum. Et álius</l><l xml:id="m-65a364ed-4064-49c8-b20e-ca8081d0e0d3" facs="#m-706c8af9-0b29-410b-b7dd-100d20b72ea9" label="lyrics-like">quidem ésurit: álius autem</l><l xml:id="m-26a460ed-2821-4550-8b74-635065f68be8" facs="#m-25ff91a3-7d8a-4432-b84c-42eab1c29354" label="lyrics-like">nicam cenam manducáre. Unus¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>